ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtCaptain = 船長連身裙 | captain's jumpskirt
    .desc = 這是一件藍色的連身裙，上面有些金色標記，標示著「上尉」的軍銜。 | It's a blue jumpskirt with some gold markings denoting the rank of "Captain".
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtHoP = 人事主管的連身裙 | head of personnel's jumpskirt
    .desc = 相當平淡無奇，也不惹人厭。簡直是從宇宙中消失的絕佳選擇。 | Rather bland and inoffensive. Perfect for vanishing off the face of the universe.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtCommandGeneric = 指揮部的連身裙 | command jumpskirt
    .desc = 一套通用款的「Command」色連身工作服，未隸屬於任何特定部門。 | A generic Command-colored jumpsuit not associated with any particular department.
ent-ClothingUniformJumpskirtCapFormalDress = 船長禮服 | captain's formal dress
    .desc = 一件適合特殊場合的洋裝。 | A dress for special occasions.
